@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000

### 1) 健康检查
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

###

### 2) 获取样例数据（用于后续请求体拼装）
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sample-data
Accept: application/json

###

### 3) 运行完整分析（将 wells/scenarios/gamma_t 替换为 /api/sample-data 返回值）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/analysis/run
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "wells": [],
  "scenarios": [],
  "gamma_t": [],
  "weights": {
    "w_energy": 0.34,
    "w_carbon": 0.33,
    "w_economic": 0.33
  },
  "Q_min": 0,
  "optional_constraints": null,
  "baseline_compare": "both"
}

###

### 3.1) 最小可运行示例（不依赖 sample-data，1口井x24时段）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/analysis/run
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "wells": [
    {
      "well_id": "W-DEMO-01",
      "name": "演示井1",
      "q_it": 0.3,
      "power_consumption": 8.0,
      "c_start_i": 30,
      "H_min_i": 6,
      "H_max_i": 24,
      "N_max_i": 2
    }
  ],
  "scenarios": [
    {
      "id": "single",
      "label": "单情景",
      "p_s": 1.0,
      "peak_price": 0.9,
      "offpeak_price": 0.4,
      "peak_hours": [9, 10, 11, 12, 13, 14, 15]
    }
  ],
  "gamma_t": [
    0.40, 0.40, 0.40, 0.40, 0.40, 0.40, 0.40, 0.40,
    0.42, 0.43, 0.44, 0.45, 0.45, 0.44, 0.43, 0.42,
    0.41, 0.40, 0.39, 0.39, 0.39, 0.39, 0.40, 0.40
  ],
  "weights": {
    "w_energy": 0.34,
    "w_carbon": 0.33,
    "w_economic": 0.33
  },
  "Q_min": 3.0,
  "optional_constraints": null,
  "baseline_compare": "both"
}

###

### 3.2) 兼容简化格式（q_it/e_it 标量；缺 weights/Q_min/gamma_t 也可）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/analysis/run
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "wells": [
    {
      "well_id": "W-SIMPLE-01",
      "q_it": 0.3,
      "e_it": 8,
      "c_start_i": 20,
      "H_min_i": 6,
      "H_max_i": 24,
      "N_max_i": 2
    }
  ],
  "scenarios": [
    {
      "id": "single",
      "p_s": 1.0,
      "peak_price": 0.9,
      "offpeak_price": 0.4,
      "peak_hours": [9, 10, 11, 12]
    }
  ]
}

###

### 4) 运行敏感性分析（weight_sets 为 null 时使用后端内置四模板）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/analysis/sensitivity
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "wells": [],
  "scenarios": [],
  "gamma_t": [],
  "Q_min": 0,
  "optional_constraints": null,
  "weight_sets": null
}

